# Creating a Text File in C#

This program creates a text file named `Barowo.text` using `File.CreateText()`. It uses `StreamWriter` and `WriteLine()` to write the student's name, university, faculty, and age into the file, with each piece of information on a separate line. The `Close()` method closes the file after writing is complete, and `MessageBox.Show()` displays a message confirming that the file was created successfully.

