# Appending Data to a Text File in C#

This program uses `File.AppendText()` to add new data to the existing `Barowo.txt` file without deleting the previous content. The `WriteLine()` method adds two lines containing the text "zaam". The `Close()` method closes the file after writing. A `try-catch` block handles errors, and `MessageBox.Show()` displays a success or error message.

