# Reading a Text File in C#

This program uses `StreamReader` and `File.OpenText()` to open and read a text file. The `while` loop reads the file line by line until the end of the file is reached. The `ReadLine()` method reads each line, and `listBox1.Items.Add()` displays the text in a ListBox. The `try-catch` block handles errors and displays a message if a problem occurs.

